Hi Len,

If there is still space, I'd like to attend the PM mini-summit
at OLS on July 22.

I don't have a specific topic to present, but I'm interested
in power management analysis/recommendation tools (such as powertop)
and extending them to support embedded configurations.

I'm not a power management expert, but I'm coming in place
of CELF's Power Management Working Group Chair who we are
in the process of replacing. (I'll try to stay quiet so it's
not like having a PHB in the room. :-)

